=== Case-normalization: PATH-DEPENDENT (not input-dependent) ===
SELECT convert_tz('2024-01-01', '+00:00', '+09:00');
ERROR 1105: execution error: unknown function: CONVERT_TZ
SELECT Microsecond(TIMESTAMP '2024-01-01 00:00:00.5');
ERROR 1105: execution error: unknown function: Microsecond
=== Bare-keyword GET_FORMAT parses but the DATE keyword errors first ===
SELECT GET_FORMAT(DATE, 'USA');
ERROR 1054: column not found: DATE
